[{"title":"赠冒武昌南还","author":"张羽（凤举","text":"五十岩廊定不迟，黑头郡节亦相宜。\n玉除晓日瞻龙衮，江夏春风废茧丝。\n门士无书通荐藁，野人有祀到生祠。\n归舟千里衡湘水，明月清秋总入诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉赠胡少参先生督饷陕藩","author":"张羽（凤举","text":"霁色望秦山，春云过渭川。\n辛勤怜去国，老大独筹边。\n相国功重问，司农位久悬。\n清江留旧业，此意亦萧然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"任城太白楼","author":"张羽（凤举","text":"山城烟柳护春寒，太白楼前送晓看。\n故冢生愁虚采石，旧恩和醉对金銮。\n登临有兴妨多病，流落难逢笑冗官。\n莫信江湖轻远适，凭高我亦望长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜雨叹","author":"顾璘","text":"朔风吹雨西北来，南山昼晦夜不开。\n寒声悲凄杂霰落，暮色黯惨兼云回。\n仰窥箕斗不辨影，俯眺八极弥黄埃。\n群鸡啁啾登树语，城角断续馀音哀。\n此时野人正愁郁，短漏颇柰铜龙催。\n残灯微明鼠上下，兀坐自画炉中灰。\n北漠群胡践边垒，西江狂贼生祸胎。\n主上动色念沟壑，何况司马诸行台。\n长星流天火堕地，荧惑扰纪何为哉。\n去年三吴遭赤旱，万户鬻子无遗孩。\n今年州司索官帑，肉瘠不救疮痍灾。\n空田苍茫飞鸟尽，野水震荡惊鳞摧。\n备民谁继子产智，足国正望夷吾才。\n龙鸣剑匣壮士老，黄金台古空崔嵬。\n海内故人掩关坐，尺书累岁谁为裁。\n阳春何时动群蛰，九域浩荡扬风雷。\n江河倒洗皇路净，台省洞达无嫌猜。\n花明草媚日杲杲，男耕女织天恢恢。\n野人多病有归处，养鸡牧豕王城隈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8631,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"紫盖黄旗拥六军，金陵王气日氤氲。\n龙君涉海移三岛，凤女排空结五云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8632,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"北固江涛控海门，南都山势叠昆崙。\n金宫暂启双龙见，玉帐遥临万马屯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8633,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其四","author":"顾璘","text":"绿水朱楼佳丽城，君王行处彩云生。\n烟花一望三千里，遥送春风入镐京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8634,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其六","author":"顾璘","text":"千年宝历自南开，八叶神孙暂北来。\n日月更临龙虎阜，云霞重抱凤凰台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8635,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其八","author":"顾璘","text":"青龙山北接飞猱，白鹭洲东射海鳌。\n不为芳春浪行幸，寝园聊待荐含桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8636,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邵伯湖寄柴墟先生","author":"张羽（凤举","text":"湖口馀寒驻客舟，乡园犹是数程留。\n短檠迟柝悲今雨，丹阙青云感旧游。\n飞鹄正酣云外路，浴鸥犹眷水中洲。\n当时万卷空多兴，通籍金闺误见收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其十","author":"顾璘","text":"旧都何让古新丰，父老称觞拜舞同。\n金马词臣休候直，独宣京兆问民风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其十二","author":"顾璘","text":"白发梨园老乐师，锦胸花帽对弹丝。\n行宫只奏中和调，解厌南朝《玉树》词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其十三","author":"顾璘","text":"石壁斜临玄武湖，中开天府贮民图。\n文鱼在藻承皇泽，来傍龙舟夜吐珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其十五","author":"顾璘","text":"朱雀桥连翠柳衢，银鞍丝鞚锦模糊。\n君王行乐千人出，遥认飞龙天马驹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8641,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武皇南巡旧京歌 其十六","author":"顾璘","text":"六代繁华何足誇，而今四海共为家。\n暂看吴苑环城水，终忆燕台夹路花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8642,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫中词 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"太液红云重，昭阳素月斜。\n龙香浮蕙草，凤辇过桃花。\n翠扇摇歌席，银屏隐卧车。\n双双紫鸾羽，飞上玉皇家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫中词 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"复道通瀛海，周垣隐洞天。\n云随珠佩女，霞覆羽衣仙。\n秀艳疏丹粉，潜悲咽管弦。\n春光閒永巷，愁坐惜流年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫中词 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"诏省长杨猎，虞人夜启关。\n霜鹰腾紫籞，天马跃朱闲。\n宝剑秋莲色，雕弓朔月弯。\n非熊谁协兆，看载后车还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫中词 其四","author":"顾璘","text":"绮阁延朱夏，花阴昼漏长。\n研砂养蜥蜴，刺绣学鸳鸯。\n细字中官扇，奇熏外国香。\n午窗兰玉梦，惊起谢君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟宫怨 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"水殿夫容隐暗霜，夜临新月自焚香。\n窗间画扇含秋思，帐里华灯隔御光。\n四壁椒涂花霭散，六宫莲漏水声长。\n君恩未必缘歌舞，无那昭阳掌上狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟宫怨 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"紫殿繁华梦已沉，掖庭苔色晚阴阴。\n浮云变态随君意，朗月流辉鉴妾心。\n屈戍横门金锁冷，辘轳牵井玉瓶深。\n空将锦瑟传哀怨，寂寞谁听空外音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟宫怨 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"翠靥金蝉入帝家，拟将新宠属铅华。\n君王自信图中貌，静女虚迎梦里车。\n帐殿秋阴生角枕，屧廊空响应琵琶。\n含情独倚朱阑暮，满院微风动落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟宫怨 其四","author":"顾璘","text":"汉皇宫殿月明时，曾侍宸游百子池。\n舞马登床春进酒，盘龙衔烛夜观棋。\n御前却辇言无忌，众里当熊死不辞。\n旧恨飘零同落叶，春风空绕万年枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟宫怨 其五","author":"顾璘","text":"咫尺长门万里遥，耻将裙绶曳纤腰。\n盈盈璧月沉鸾镜，渺渺银河断鹊桥。\n上苑旌旗回夜猎，建章钟鼓散晨朝。\n此身不及双栖凤，处处随君听九《韶》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟宫怨 其六","author":"顾璘","text":"流苏帐冷璅窗虚，云月差差度玉除。\n百岁精灵悲故剑，九重恩宠附前鱼。\n莲花有恨凝芳履，竹叶无光引属车。\n人意已疏言更浅，莫将词赋倚相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟宫怨 其七","author":"顾璘","text":"不见彤墀日月旂，庭隅草木掩清辉。\n金舆到处无新故，玉貌从来有是非。\n暮雨楼台双燕入，春寒池馆百花稀。\n监宫一去无人语，独自含颦咏绿衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟夏日宫中行乐词 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"紫霄不与下方同，秋爽常回六月中。\n风羽对摇云母榻，冰池全浸水晶宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟夏日宫中行乐词 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"玉面朱唇映月明，影娥池畔绕花行。\n夫容不耐凋残色，祇恐新凉一夜生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8655,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟夏日宫中行乐词 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"雾縠云绡细欲无，倚风临水弱须扶。\n玉鱼疗渴辞盘露，纨扇伤秋对井梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8656,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"申思三首 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"戚戚岁云暮，我行适潇湘。\n兄弟持我泣，父母泪纵横。\n云有薄田畴，卒岁具粢梁。\n胡为去万里，骨肉相乖张。\n局蹐诉父母，儿自恋家乡。\n举事触明宪，置理窜南荒。\n程期若星火，不得少留行。\n勿复远思念，兄弟善持将。\n吞声出门闾，沉痛绝衷肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8657,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"申思三首 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"白日匿西景，扶桑复东辉。\n岐路南以北，往来更践之。\n人生百年内，赋命良不齐。\n凤凰翔九霄，闻韶下来仪。\n朝食丹山粟，夕饮天汉涯。\n驽骀服鞭策，曲阪驱且驰。\n驱驰岂遑恤，所嗟意乖违。\n一为北山叹，听者心伤悲。\n苍天高无极，悠悠当诉谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8658,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"申思三首 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"南征上衡岳，长顾望旧都。\n日月光回薄，钟陵郁苍梧。\n朱凤何葳蕤，竹实日摧芜。\n虎豹对我号，枭鸱噭相呼。\n我行迫日暮，驽马忽匍匐。\n战兢伤心魂，慄慄忧道途。\n朅投主人舍，胁息告勤劬。\n怜我客异县，携我就大巫。\n服我勾漏砂，佩我太乙符。\n再拜谢主人，归来始安居。\n弃置勿复道，多忧令人老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8659,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自龙江发舟至京口江水如镜呈陈大鲁南","author":"顾璘","text":"海门东下大江平，画舸夷犹尽日程。\n绿树倏过瓜步堰，青山背指石头城。\n离筵醉酒思高枕，独客辞家慰远行。\n况有故人同晚泊，西津相引看潮生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8660,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行药至溪南偶成","author":"顾璘","text":"抱痾掩荆扉，出户已寒节。\n新晴步南溪，草际见残雪。\n仰视日光微，始惊天气冽。\n敝裘有馀温，浊酒堪独啜。\n羸躯苟能存，暄月会当别。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8661,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧溪","author":"顾璘","text":"落落高梧阴，俯瞰寒流碧。\n微云过疏雨，秋容澹无迹。\n鱼游绿藻晴，鸟下青芜夕。\n兴至每垂纶，歌罢还岸帻。\n渔父两三人，时来共争席。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8662,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠孙思和","author":"顾璘","text":"东林一片石，绿藓生秋痕。\n时招葛巾客，对坐倾匏尊。\n俯爱涧下水，仰观枝上猿。\n谁能策羸马，日夕依朱门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8663,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东郑生","author":"顾璘","text":"图史聊足娱，胡为苦多营。\n经旬谢宾客，春草当门生。\n白发午未栉，青山时独行。\n萧萧树上瓢，莫与风俱鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8664,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吴山人","author":"顾璘","text":"昔游洞庭麓，萝阴覆君堂。\n开窗湖水绿，举酒橙花香。\n别来婴时网，欲济苦无梁。\n东风送君至，烟霞满衣裳。\n泠泠泉石谈，洗我尘土肠。\n山僧忽已化，阶树今渐长。\n叹息浮世事，因之念沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8665,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐学士子容薜荔园十二首 其六 蔷微洞","author":"顾璘","text":"百丈蔷薇枝，缭绕成洞房。\n密叶翠帷重，秾花红锦张。\n对著玉局棋，遣此朱夏长。\n香云落衣袂，一月留馀芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8666,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐学士子容薜荔园十二首 其八 柏屏","author":"顾璘","text":"壁立青玉屏，下见古柏根。\n相怜岁寒叶，郁作苍云屯。\n贞姿洗霜雪，老气横乾坤。\n名园非此种，谁可当君门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8667,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐学士子容薜荔园十二首 其四 蕉石亭","author":"顾璘","text":"怪石如笔格，上植蕉叶青。\n苍然太古色，得尔增娉婷。\n欲携一斗墨，叶底书《黄庭》。\n拂拭坐盘薄，风雨秋冥冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8668,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和泾川公纳凉以五平属上去入声作三诗 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"烦心如枯鱼，展转想斗水。\n凉飙从西来，猛雨爽我耳。\n初临前轩看，返洒已满几。\n青松披鲜云，野景晚转美。\n庭花瑶簪长，韡韡拟缟李。\n谁怀逢秋悲，且展解暑喜。\n泾川神仙才，匪与朽腐比。\n新辞敷烟霞，缥缈起短纸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8669,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和泾川公纳凉以五平属上去入声作三诗 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"劳劳南州符，讵遂闭户卧。\n休衙经旬居，茂树恣意坐。\n生涯嗟蓬飘，世事付甑破。\n民忧疮弥深，岁序梦易过。\n江鸥邀东还，戏棹见万个。\n长风驱洪波，聚散互荡簸。\n高人逃深岩，静啸厌众和。\n阳城何其愚，计驾奏下课。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8670,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和泾川公纳凉以五平属上去入声作三诗 其三","author":"顾璘","text":"蓬莱从灵仙，绝粒食白石。\n何如临清秋，忽释触热厄。\n江云翻鸣涛，洑沫雪一尺。\n疏篁摇凉飔，隔屋叶摵摵。\n清泠留侯居，月阁辟七夕。\n陶情时开尊，博剧或设弈。\n伊余婴离忧，契阔薄物役。\n公毋怀南征，卒乞别北客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8671,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答徐昌谷博士","author":"顾璘","text":"前年共饮燕京酒，高楼雪花三尺厚。\n酣歌彻夜惊四邻，世事浮沉果何有。\n一为法吏少书来，心结愁云惨不开。\n昨传学省移新籍，坐啸空斋日几回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8672,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周别驾宅看花","author":"顾璘","text":"周侯方庭大如案，四叙种花香不断。\n日高散衙一事无，手汲清池自浇灌。\n鲜英的皪赤瑛珠，密萼纷披紫丝幔。\n芳根异种多难识，粉蝶黄蜂暗相唤。\n西邻迂叟饶闲情，叩户时来索花看。\n一来一醉酒千钟，月俸依稀费多半。\n君侯莫厌频来过，人生乐少忧患多。\n与君聚散同落叶，不醉花前将奈何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8673,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张司徒所画山国图歌","author":"顾璘","text":"滇南一道盘云上，永昌巍巍更相望。\n水流直下洱海深，陆地夫容矗相向。\n小石纷磊磊，大石高盘陀。\n连空互撑叠，仰睇青嵯峨。\n攒峰插牛斗，飞涧悬天河。\n崩崖倾断下无地，但见猿猱挂罥号烟萝。\n丹砂空青，的皪岩阿。\n宝玉夜烱，灵光荡摩。\n天门洞开，紫宫逶迤。\n玉女对侍，星官骈罗。\n至高之极始见此，辽绝下奈诸方何。\n马蹄缄铁尚不得度，行人跛鳖焉能过。\n我生水国多见水，不图山高乃如此。\n画家山水贵相半，吁嗟谁悉寰区理。\n南园大老司徒公，维山降神为世雄。\n晚张能事发新格，尽吐磈礧之心胸。\n引缣迅扫鸣长风，颠林倒壑貌不同。\n苍云黯惨喧霹雳，白日照耀开鸿濛。\n蛟龙盘拿古木死，蝀螮漂疾飞梁通。\n千峦万嶂堆墨华，忽然平旷披风沙。\n楪榆开凿巂君国，桃源点缀秦人家。\n孤城四面削玄壁，危楼仄立明丹霞。\n时清颇知官府静，化远亦爱蛮夷嘉。\n老翁戏猎逐黄犬，娇女明妆簪素花。\n形胜分明在指顾，风俗想像增咨嗟。\n腾冲靡莫馀千里，部落微茫分远迩。\n更挥淡墨洒馀姿，遂使天涯穷尺纸。\n昨逢伯子示此图，瞠目惊叹从前无。\n乃知山岳气磅礴，不用滥漫谈江湖。\n今之好山有二老，太原司马吴门都。\n见此寄书定相索，公乎公乎须写数本万里络绎传吾徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8674,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月十三夜与文济时范质甫城西泛舟达秦淮三首 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"落日清川里，轻风已自凉。\n秋怀生白舫，山翠扑胡床。\n问路疑天上，停杯待月光。\n何人横铁笛，吹过斗牛傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8675,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月十三夜与文济时范质甫城西泛舟达秦淮三首 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"六代烟华地，狂歌得夜游。\n山河横王气，水月弄清秋。\n木落长干寺，云残太白楼。\n共君须痛饮，沉醉傍沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8676,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴都台东湖书屋八首 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"水汇苍梧郭，天开绿野堂。\n云山秋滴翠，冰井夏生凉。\n药满寻诗径，花垂点易床。\n少须康济罢，散发任徜徉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8677,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠何司空子元","author":"顾璘","text":"白日难回照，丹心尽此生。\n司空官岂左，集议礼多名。\n国是归牵引，皇衷自圣明。\n玉阶沾泣日，真见老臣情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8678,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠徐堂","author":"顾璘","text":"小阮龙驹子，长途拂剑归。\n毗陵三尺雪，寒满黑貂衣。\n骨肉行踪散，风尘客鬓稀。\n平原招不起，豪士竟谁依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8679,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕和边太常庭实","author":"顾璘","text":"守岁椒盘宴，欢然傍老亲。\n诵诗从稚子，分肉遍邻人。\n菽水惭三釜，柴荆寄一身。\n青灯能送喜，金蕊夜开频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8680,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正旦","author":"顾璘","text":"乾坤仍献岁，车骑正归休。\n礼乐今王作，门庭旧客留。\n老馀耽酒癖，贫有卖书谋。\n所愿皇舆正，吾生岂浪愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8681,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿宜兴东坡祠下","author":"顾璘","text":"先生聊一念，遗庙竟千年。\n不返辽东鹤，长悲阳羡田。\n月高群木影，人语一溪烟。\n世事皆春梦，吾今且醉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8682,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠子鱼","author":"顾璘","text":"与子三年别，重来鬓已苍。\n论心风雨夕，下榻水云乡。\n画阁灯花煖，秋杯竹叶凉。\n匆匆行止意，相对两彷徨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8683,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"共泛东潭饯望之","author":"顾璘","text":"高人同野兴，移棹水西东。\n岸仄垂萝古，沙虚积蓼红。\n哀筝悽断壑，轻帻倚秋风。\n更有浮萍感，俱忘痛饮中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8684,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚辰元日","author":"顾璘","text":"诸侯玉帛会长安，天子旌旗下楚关。\n共想正元趋紫殿，翻劳边将从金鞍。\n沧江饮马波先静，黄竹回銮雪正乾。\n北极巍巍天咫尺，五云长护凤楼寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8685,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春忆野亭少傅","author":"顾璘","text":"夷门回首限风烟，遥夜天涯有梦悬。\n颂德敢言三代下，受恩今忆十年前。\n安危海内占容鬓，贫乏山中倚俸钱。\n早晚上书辞郡绂，野堂还借片云眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8686,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侯城里 其一","author":"顾璘","text":"万壑千厓控海门，愁云不散昼长昏。\n王裒枉积林间泪，荀息难招阙下魂。\n直以孤忠悬日月，不劳遗草落乾坤。\n椒浆欲奠知何处，古木含风自吐吞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8687,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侯城里 其二","author":"顾璘","text":"一点麻衣入帝庭，九天风雨昼冥冥。\n云迷杜宇游魂黑，草染苌弘野血青。\n四海衣冠收节槩，万年宗社属神灵。\n英雄已去心难死，长倚南箕化列星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8688,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄许州七弟瑮","author":"顾璘","text":"千官扈从羡能文，谪牧新声天下闻。\n落魄吾家苏季子，风流南郡小冯君。\n鱼龙路怯黄河险，鸿雁声愁碧海分。\n莫上吹台瞻越峤，五湖回首隔重云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8689,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]